  "description": "_He bought me for 50 sacks of rice._\n\nSoongap is nearly beaten to death by his master when friendly giant Bongchun buys him and saves his life. Bongchun's blind mother is delighted, believing her son has finally brought home a bride. And the more Bongchun treats Soongap like his darling bride, the more things get heated... \n\n_(Source: Manta)_\n\n## Notes\n- Includes 18 extra chapters.\n- The main series ended in 2022. A sequel side story titled \"Fisherman Bongchun\" (어부봉춘) was serialized on RIDI in 2025. The side story is available in English on Manta and Lezhin US as bonus episodes.",
